ok   Parseval norm=None: sum|X|^2 = n * sum|x|^2  (n=40)  (lib 96200.000000 exact 96200.000000)
ok   Parseval for ifft norm=None: sum|x_inv|^2 = sum|X|^2 / n  (lib 60.125000 exact 60.125000)
ok   Parseval norm='ortho': sum|X|^2 = 1 * sum|x|^2  (n=40)  (lib 2405.000000 exact 2405.000000)
